# Movie Ticket Booking System

## Project Overview

The Movie Ticket Booking System is a web-based application that allows users to browse movies, view showtimes, select seats, and book movie tickets online. It reduces manual booking work and provides a simple and convenient booking experience.

## Objectives

* To make movie ticket booking easy and convenient.
* To display available movies and showtimes.
* To allow users to select seats and book tickets online.
* To calculate the total ticket price automatically.
* To provide booking confirmation and booking history.

## Main Features

* User registration and login.
* Browse available movies.
* View movie details and showtimes.
* Select seats and calculate ticket prices.
* Confirm and cancel bookings.
* View booking history.
* Admin management of movies and shows.

## Technologies Used

* Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript.
* Backend: Java / Python / Node.js.
* Database: MySQL / MongoDB.
* Tools: Git and GitHub.

## Expected Outcome

The system provides an easy-to-use platform for online movie ticket booking, improves booking efficiency, and reduces errors in seat allocation.

## Future Enhancements

* Online payment integration.
* QR-code-based tickets.
* Email or SMS notifications.
* Movie ratings and reviews.
* Mobile application support.
